<title>USA: Cenit Bancorp Q3 shr declines, inc charge.</title>
<headline>Cenit Bancorp Q3 shr declines, inc charge.</headline>
<text>
<p>NORFOLK, Va., Oct 18 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss   $0.07	  profit  $0.22</p>
<p> Net	loss   115	    profit  375</p>
<p> Net interest inc5,121		    4,538</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,602		    1,685</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	profit $1.38	  profit  $1.29</p>
<p> Net	profit 2,309	  profit  2,150</p>
<p> Net interest inc14,791		   13,567</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,676		    1,673</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Cenit Bancorp</p>
<p>NOTE: Third quarter 1996 earnings and net income include a $1.45 million after tax one time special assessment to recapitalize its share of the Savings Association Insurance Fund, as mandated by U.S. law. The third quarter 1995 included $753,000 for merger expenses.</p>
